"<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-"
"html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style "
